\par
Chapter Nine: Tunnels and Trolls\par
\par
As refreshing as this detour had been, they all knew that they could not stay forever, and on the fourth day, Cheska and her party bid farewell to dwarves and headed northwest to carry out their part of the bargain. The plan was to deal with the trolls, and then continue straight forward through the tunnels, to find out more about what happened to Earthflame.\par
