Dorothy: "You are enthusiastic about this."\par
Cheska: "This entire quest has lost me two of my best friends. I will not have them have died in vain."\par
Saurian: "It sounds a lot like gambling to me: you lose some money while playing, so instead of quitting right there, you keep going so that you could get that money back, but only end up losing more."\par
Cheska: "...You did not just compare the deaths of Silan and Xel with a game of knucklebones?"\par
Saurian: "The principle is the same. Especially with what we know about Earthflame and how well it's defended."\par
Cheska: "But you wish to avenge Xel as well?"\par
